1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,473
That fourth power is dramatic.

2
00:00:02,473 --> 00:00:06,822
Halve the radius, and the flow drops to one sixteenth.

3
00:00:06,822 --> 00:00:13,033
Sixteen cups of blood through a healthy artery, one cup through an artery narrowed to half.

4
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:18,242
That is why even a slight narrowing of an artery makes the heart work so hard.

